OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786886309
OL,3,CFamily of dad-of-four 'broken' as
OL,4,Ckiller jailed
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died after
OL,7,Fbeing assaulted in a pub say they have
OL,8,Fbeen left with a "life sentence" after
OL,9,Fhis attacker was jailed.
OL,11,FFather-of-four Tony Powles, 62,
OL,12,Fsuffered a fatal head injury after
OL,13,Fbeing floored by a single punch at the
OL,14,FRed Lion pub in Wakefield on 9 October
OL,15,Flast year and died in hospital 13 days
OL,16,Flater.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
