PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1786886309
OL,3,CFamily of dad-of-four 'broken' as
OL,4,Ckiller jailed
OL,6,FTemporary Det Ch Insp Eleanor
OL,7,FBuchanan, of West Yorkshire Police,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Mannion's violent actions sadly
OL,9,Frobbed a much-loved father and
OL,10,Fgrandfather of his life... This case
OL,11,Fsadly highlights the appalling
OL,12,Fconsequences such violent acts can
OL,13,Fhave and how even just one punch can
OL,14,Flead to a person losing their life."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/4
